# Three Go images build from backend/, so that `replace ../commons-go` resolves inside the context.
*/dist/
*/*/dist/
**/.git
**/*.exe
**/node_modules/

# The api-linter-service builder downloads these linters; a host copy must not replace them.
# api-linter-service/.dockerignore does not apply to a backend/ context.
api-linter-service/resources/spectral/linux/spectral
api-linter-service/resources/spectral/windows/spectral.exe
api-linter-service/resources/vacuum/linux/vacuum
api-linter-service/resources/vacuum/windows/vacuum.exe
